{"text": " With the Moon agent's desktop app, you can set up a virtual account for your agent. So what is a virtual account? A virtual account is a special type of bank account that allows you to deposit US dollars or Euros and automatically convert them to stable coins in a wallet that you own. To set up a virtual account, first ask your agent to create a virtual account. The agent will give you a link to KYC and verify your identity and then allow you to set up a virtual bank account just for your agent. Once you have that virtual account, you can transfer money directly into that bank account or set up a direct deposit that automatically transfers your paycheck directly into that bank account. Once the stable coins land in your wallet, you can set up automations that allow you to deposit into lending protocols, swap into any token on any chain or optimize a portfolio of assets. Your agents can run your money on autopilot and never run out of money.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.9199999999999986, "end": 5.9, "text": " With the Moon agent's desktop app, you can set up a virtual account for your agent.", "tokens": [50364, 2022, 264, 10714, 9461, 311, 14502, 724, 11, 291, 393, 992, 493, 257, 6374, 2696, 337, 428, 9461, 13, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15704600377516312, "compression_ratio": 1.793103448275862, "no_speech_prob": 0.16575299203395844, "words": [{"word": " With", "start": 0.9199999999999986, "end": 1.52, "probability": 0.29824936389923096}, {"word": " the", "start": 1.52, "end": 1.72, "probability": 0.9391382336616516}, {"word": " Moon", "start": 1.72, "end": 1.9, "probability": 0.6639944314956665}, {"word": " agent's", "start": 1.9, "end": 2.42, "probability": 0.5202552452683449}, {"word": " desktop", "start": 2.42, "end": 2.7, "probability": 0.9670543074607849}, {"word": " app,", "start": 2.7, "end": 3.04, "probability": 0.9950597882270813}, {"word": " you", "start": 3.58, "end": 3.64, "probability": 0.9889481067657471}